    <title>【Vol.42】我的大事，可能只是你的小事？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6aaea4b5ac389df827346124</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6aaea4b5ac389df827346124</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期主题】</span></p><p></p><p><span>老张和小刘常常用浓人形容自己，任何事情都能刺激到我们。这次的飞行嘉宾汤汤，从说话的语音语调都能听出她的淡然。</span></p><p></p><p><span>那么浓人和淡人中间到底隔了层什么？原来我们觉得情绪起伏超级大的事情，对淡人来说，只是一句：emmm</span></p><p></p><p><span>【本期在聊】</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="169">02:49</a> 我们自己怎么理解浓人和淡人？</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="302">05:02</a> 淡人看《阿嬷的情书》竟然能一滴眼泪都没流？</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="560">09:20</a> 小刘简直是感受放大器</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="651">10:51</a>&nbsp; 浓人和淡人“开心，难过，愤怒，失落”的感受</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1220">20:20</a> 淡人的表达几乎都是3分</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1513">25:13</a> 没有期待，就没有失落</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1769">29:29</a> 老张业余打网球都想赢！</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2143">35:43</a> 浓人连爱好都要给自己压力</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2257">37:37</a> 浓人想要活得久，淡人想要活得猛？</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2438">40:38</a> 来听听浓人老张最近的愤怒点，快劝劝她</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3020">50:20</a> 浓人小刘总是有些坚持</span></p><p></p><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><p></p><p><span>Bailemen Swing-The Shanghai Restoration Project</span></p><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
